<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Mɛkana ɛ Pyɛɛd, yii bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pyɛɛd yii Bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pyɛɛd yii Bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Py</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pyɛɛd, yii bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pyɛɛd yii bhɔɔba</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak nakwyalaa ɛ étɛp ekeletyɛ djas, ye ɛ́ dáa mɛkpa mɛ ɛmwana. Mot nakwyal mɛkana tak ɛpelɛɛ náá, ɛsyee ɛ lɛ moo ɛ́ eezekunaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:13">1.13</ref></char>). Nyɛ eekwyal yɛ étɛp bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, neetetaala nɛ mɛlyo mɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛpewaab nɛ nɔɔ ɛ náá, bɛ baal mbɛɛ mɛfulu di edus tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ di sosoob nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛ nagwak ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1">1</ref></char>). Ye ɛpebaalyo bɛmbee bɛlyoel di elyo bot etɛp esua-sua náá, nɛ ɛkɛ dáa di ààgoka ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2">2</ref></char>). Bhii tak, ye ɛpebaalii dum nɛ ɛwala ee Ghɛŋ Yezu aabula ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3">3</ref></char>). Kana mɛkɛn mɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala, ekeletyɛ e koko mɛbyel tak nazegwyɛ, Yezu dinaa ààpabula. Bɛdhiiti bot moo ɛ́ zɛm-zɛm, bɛ aakagu étɛp yé edi boya ɛ. Tin, dáa dinaa bot zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ tɔ bwood ɛ, ekwyala di tɔ mɛkana ɛpelyaal náá, Zɛɛb eetel náá, nyɛ mot bwood. Tin, nyɛ eedjɛ nɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas ze ɛswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Étɛp ɛkwyee bɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, mot keletyɛ ɔ, goka ɛwa lyem tɔ ekwyala bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb e ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa. Bɛ baagoka nɛ ɛwa tɔ mɛlyo mɛ bɛ nagwak nɛ bɛtsasɛs ɛ Yezu Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:2">3.2</ref></char>). E sok mɛkana mɛ bhɔɔba ɛ Pyɛɛd nadi ekwyalaa ɛ, bɛdhiiti bɛmɛkana ɛ Pɔl naaguaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:15">3.15</ref></char>). Sa mot ààsaa ɛgu etɛp di ekwyala tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ wɔ di ààgu mɛsuk mɛ tak tɔ Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:20">1.20</ref></char>), nɛghu àànyɔ ɛtiibal ɛsok nɛ ɛlyo bot (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:16">3.16</ref></char>). E sok bɛdhiiti ekeletyɛ nɛ yii sisim na Dɛɛ di ezyɛ zɛkwyee bin ɛ, ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd, kwom e mɛsa nɛ mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto. Mɛ kwyeed mɛkana mak ɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ di nɛ kɔkɔ mbɛɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ les nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ epiki e Zɛɛb'es Mɛtsik-bot yis Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem di nɛ nen etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu Zɛɛb nɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka!<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛwa zii tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Nɛ mɛbwala mɛ, Ghɛŋ nadjɛ mena esa djas mena nadi nɛ yɛ gwyes tak ɛ étɛp mena neekɛka ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, nɛ ghwyil'ɛ met, nyɛ eetel mena mot nadjóo mena tɔ duma yɛ ɔ, étɛp mena needika bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Tɔ duma yenek, nɛ tɔ mɛbwala menek, Zɛɛb naakɛk mena eboo etɛtɛ ekɛk. Deenek, ɛbela bi aabela ekɛk binek ɛ, yɛ aasa náá, embee mɛkwosak mɛ bɔs'ak di eleeg bot ɛ, dus tɔ len. Tin bi aakadi ɛ́ bot ɛ di nɛ mbɛɛ sisim dáa Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛkɛl kɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb, ɛkɛ tɔ tsik epiki. Deenek, bhis ɛkɛ tɔ tsik epiki, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaadi nɛ tɛtɛ ɛgu esa ee Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>Kɔ ɛgu esa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ, da bi ɛ baagu ɛdjɛɛd mɛnyel men. Bhis ɛdjɛɛd mɛnyel men, da bi ɛ baadi lyem bhwood. Kɔ lyem bhwood, da bi ɛ baadi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>Tin, tɔ ɛdi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb, dika nɛ tɛtɛ kwyɛl nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bin e zɛɛga mendjaala. Bhis ɛdi nɛ tɛtɛ ɛgwakel pak'en, dika tɔ kwyɛl. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ nɛ mbɛɛ mɛfulu menek ɔɔ, da bi ɛ didi esesa yɛ ɔɔ. Yɛ waadjedjɛ etɛtɛ bhum tɔ len, deenek, bi aakatɔ́ sok tɔ ɛgu ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Mot di ààbɛ nɛ mbɛɛ mɛfulu menek ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot edhim: nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ mis mendiila. Mbii yenɔk mot eedjisa náá, Zɛɛb naazedis edhuud ɛ mesyem mɛ na mwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛlyaal náá, ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ nadjóo bin nɛ baatɔ́ bin. Tin, bi ɛ di esa deenek ɔɔ, bi aanàkabaabema ɛbɛk. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Deenek ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ waabɛɛ bin ze ɛni ɛ tɔ ɛyoŋ ɛ na kɔm-kɔm ɛ Mɛtsik bot'enaka Yezu Klisto, Ghɛŋ'ena. <verse eid="2PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ aagheetetaala bin etɛp binek. Mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi nɛ gu ye ɛnyɔɛpe, ɛkwosak ɛ lam ɛ náá, bi pyet ɛlyelɛpe tɔ sosoob nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ bi nagwak ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Mɛ bee ɛ náá, dáa mɛ dinaa nɛ tsik ɛ, mɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgheetetaala bin etɛp binek étɛp bi needi djem. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Tin, mɛ nɛ gu náá, dwoo ɛsyee ɛ lam moo kunaa, dáa Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto naazetel mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Deenek, mɛ waasa náá, ye nakozoodi bhis ɛsyee ɛ lam, bi gheetetaala nɛ etɛp bak.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ nabee duma ɛ Klisto ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Eghɛŋ bis nalɛɛ bin etɛp dum nɛ ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ'es Yezu Klisto tɔ boo mɛbwala mɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ kɔ esesa esua-sua. Tin, ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ bɛtyaasɛs nabee mɛkas mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Deenek, nyɛ naabela duu nɛ duma Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. E ɛwala ɛlenek, gwood ɛ Zɛɛb nagek tɔ boo mɛkas ɛ náá: «Mot'ak ɛ mɔn'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ mɛ natɔ́ nɛ mɛmyaala djas<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17.5</ref>. </char></note>.» <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Bisɔ bɛmet naagwak gwood dáa nagek pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ, e sok bis nadi sama wat nɛ nɛ pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ na dɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Tin, bis nɛ wa lyem tɔ mɛpka mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛpka Zɛɛb. Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, bi baagoka ɛ nɛ kobaka nɛ yɛ: ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ lambi di egoo tɔ ghooghom ɛ, kɛkum ɛwala mɛlem di elem ɛ, da mɛkas mɛ dwoo ɛdjɛ gwyɛ tɔ elyem bin ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Tin, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ gu náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛgoola mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dáa lyem ɛ kwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Ye tok nɛ sa bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ náá yɛ aasael di edus nɛ ɛkwosak bɔɔ bɛmet. Ye ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ nadi edjɛ bɛ ghwyil ɛlii etɛp binek.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mbee bɛlyoel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Eghɛŋ na mwa, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ pɛ tɔ ɛdhuu mɛ bɔɔ Yisalaɛl. Yɛ aabaadiɛ ɛ nɛ bɛmbee bɛlyoel tɔ len. Bɛ waalyo bin mɛlyo mɛ esua-sua di ewa bi tɔ mbee baka ɛ étɛp bi neewo ze. Tin, bɛ waaswonal tɛtɛ lyoel, mot natsik bɛ ɔ. Bɛ aadul mbee baka kɔ lɔɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ waadu mbee mɛfulu mɛ mɛzɔ mɔɔ. Tin, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ, mbula bot ɛ waalee mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Dum nɛ dɔɔb mɛvu, bɛ wasa náá, bɛ wyisal bin epata kɔ ɛsu ɛ mbee mɛlyo mɛ esua-sua. Deenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ feŋ'ɔɔ eezeguaa, tin, ye kalik ɛ batsa bɛ waabee mezuk mɔɔ.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Tin, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààpel efofop nasyem ɔ, nyɛ naaka bɛ nɛ bhel tɔ boo du, pɛ kyee bɛ di ekɔɔla nɛ kel egwooz e mbok tɔ ghooghom ebwood epɛ́ɛ bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Tyee wat, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààpel bot ɛ na mwa, e sok nyɛ nadesal bɔs nɛ boo bhyoŋ. Eghɛŋ tak bɔs nabɛ ɛ́ «tɔɔɔ» nɛ bot ɛ di esa etɛp Zɛɛb di ààkwyɛl ɔ. Tin, nyɛ nazootsik ɛ Noe, mot nadi egoola mɛkpa mɛ epiki ɛ, zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti bot bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Zɛɛb naawa mbee baka kɔ eghaada Sodɔm nɛ Ghomɔɔd. Deenek, nyɛ nagó ye ɛ́ nɛ du. Tin, ye ɛ́ dhatyee nyɛ waasa nɛ bot ɛ di ekaab Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Tin, Zɛɛb naapɛk Lɔt mot epiki, mot nadi ekpaa lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛ embee mɛfulu mɛ mɛzɔ ee bot ɛ di egó bot ɔ eghaada binek di esa ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Yɛ kabɛ Lɔt, mot epiki yenɔk nadidi ɛ pak bot ɛ nadi nɛ mbee tsik'ɔɔ. Tin, nyɛ nadi e bee nɛ ɛgwak ɛ bɛ mɛlu nɛ mɛlu. E di'enek, lyem epiki bɛ nadi e zuk e ɛbee embee mɛfulu menek. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Deenek, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ náá, Ghɛŋ ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛpɛk bot ɛ di sosoob nɛ nɛ tɔ mezuk ɔ. Tin, nyɛ aanɛɛg bot ɛ mbee tsik étɛp ɛwa bɛ e feŋ dwoo epɛ́ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Tin, nyɛ aawa tɔ feŋ bot djas ɛ di nɛ gwyes ɛdi tɔ edhuu ɔɔ, bot ɛ di kɛ tɔ gwyes epuud da bɛ ɛ́ dhuugal Ghɛŋ ɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Bɛ ɛ́ bɛmbee bɛlyoel binɔk, bɛ nɛ Ghɛɛa mɛnyel, bɛ tok nɛ bwoo ɛnyek ɛ esisim duma di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Bela náá, efofop tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ kolee-leeak esisim e tak sok bhwoob Ghɛŋ. Dhi bot di egu náá, bɛ eedhaa bɛlyoel binɔk nɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛbwala. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Tin, bot binɔk ɛ dáa bɛtit, ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ. Bɛ nasaa ɛ étɛp bɛ neebel elaab, bhii tak, da bɛ góaa. Mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ ɛlee sa bɛ di ààgu ɛ, bɛ aagwyɛ ɛ́ dáa bɛtit. <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Bɛ waabela ɛ mbee tsik dáa efute kɔ mbee tsik'ɔɔ. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛ ɛmyaala tɔ mbee etɛp e mwos dwoo. Eghɛŋ bi di ebɔl mɛbyoŋ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Yɔbɔ mɛsa kɔ mɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛkɔɔ bin étɛp bɛ neegheesesa etɛp syen elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Mis mɔɔ ɛ mis mɛ mɛzɔ, bɛ ààdjil tɔ syem. Mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ́ ɛkɔp bot ɛ di tyak mis ɔ. Bɛ ɛ́ bɛ na ghaa dɔɔb mɛvu. Tin, mbee baka ɛ́ kɔ lɔɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Bhii bɛ nadus kɔ tɛtɛ ze ɛ, bɛ eezɛwo ze. Bɛ kadu ɛ ze ɛ Bhalaam mɔɔ Bozɔɔd, mot nadyeebakwyɛl efute kɔ ɛsu ɛ mbee tsik ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>Tin, dáa Zɛɛb nabyo nɛ nɔɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdjak ɛ lɔɔ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́. Tin, Zɛɛb naalii nɛ goolel mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Bhalam tɔ nuub yaaga yɛ náá, nyɛ kat ewo ee nyɛ di esa ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Bɛ mbee bɛlyoel binɔk ɛ dáa esɔɔgɔ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, dáa eguud di ewaazel nɛ pup tɔ gwoo ɛ. Zɛɛb naazekoobal bɛ di pɛ kyee aabookɛdi tɔ mbee mɛghomla ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Tin, mɛlyo mɔɔ ɛ́ ɛdjoaŋɛpe, ye bu ɛ boo mɛnyeka. Bɛ ɛpebatakɔp bot tɔ tsik epuud, nɛ tɔ mɛzɔ mɔɔ, bot ɛ di aaloonɛdus tɔ bot ɛ mbee tsik ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>E di'enek, bɛ kɛk bɛ ɛ mɛpɛka, ghuna bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ tɔ ekwom e bhel mbee mɛfulu mɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, mot nɛ mot ɛ kwom sa di edhaa nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Deenek, bot ɛ zegu Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto Mɛtsik'enaka ɔ, bɛ eezebet mbee mɛfulu mɛ bɔs. Tin, bɛ baabet náá, bɛ baaduma tɔ etɛp binek ɔɔ, e di'enek, ekwom bɔɔ aadhaa yii sok. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka náá, bɛ gu ze epiki. Ààbɛ náá, bɛ gu da bhii tak, bɛ ɛzɛliig koŋ mɛtiŋ mɛ na dɛɛ nagoolaa bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Tin, sa di esa bɛ mos ɛ, yɛ kwyala tɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 2:22">«Bhyɛ ɛpebaadɛ sa nyɛ paago ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 2:22">ghwyee zegwyiiaa ɔ, nyɛ eebaabula tɔ bhɔtɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Eka 26.11</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ghɛŋ moo kɔ nɛ ɛbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Bɛwɛn bam, ye mɛ di ekwyal bin'aak moo ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ bhɔɔba. Tɔ bɛmɛkana menek djas ebá mɛ ɛpekwyɛl náá, esimza bin ɛdi djem nɛ egeka bin ɛ di sɛŋ. Kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp bak djas mɛ di etetaala bin ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>E di'enek, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ náá, bi tetaala nɛ mɛkpa ee bɛngoolel-mɛkpa Zɛɛb na dɛɛ nagoola ɛ. Deenek, baataalaka nɛ mɛtiŋ ee Ghɛŋ Mɛtsik-bot nadjɛ bot ɛ lwoma náá, bɛ lyo bin ɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgu sok náá, ye mɛlu mɛ mɛsik mɛ bɔs, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di esuu ɛ mɛso, bot ɛ ebeme di esa etɛp ekwosak elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>Bɛ waadi eke náá: «Nyɛ nakɛk ɛbula, etsal e? “Ha” nenak nyɛ ɛ́ paa? Etɛɛ náá, bɛbhaab bis eezegwyɛ, etɛp djas ààpaswola kana mɛkɛn mɛ bhwak.» <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Tin, e sok bɛ di eke deenek ɛ, bɛ ɛpedjisa nɛ laŋ náá, ye nadi sok ɛ nɛ gwoo, wɔ gwaa bɔs zɛtuula tɔ mɛdii nɛ mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek, nyɛ naazɛbɛk bɔs nɛ mɛdii, bɔs nakusaa ɛ nɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ mɛdii bhyoŋ, ye ɛ́ nɛ mɛdii mɛ boo bhyoŋ nadesal bɔs ɛ ee bot ɛ namwa nagwyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Yɛ kabɛ gwoo nɛ bɔs ee bot dika mos'aak, mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb naazelɛɛ nɛ nes náá, yɛ aagóaa ɛ nɛ du. E di'enek, du tak ɛ nɛɛga étɛp dwoo mɛpɛɛa, bot ɛ di ààkaab Zɛɛb waagóaa tɔ tak.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Bɛwɛn bam, ye ɛ́ nɛ sa wat dinaa sa bi ààdjisa ɛ. Guka náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 3:8">Pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛlu wat ɛ dhatyee membu mil (1 000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 3:8">membu mil ɛ dhatyee ɛlu wat pɛ daa lɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Mɛd 90.4</ref>. </char></note>.<verse eid="2PE 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Deenek, Ghɛŋ aanàbaabɔya nɛ ɛsa sa nyɛ nakɛk ɛ. Dáa bɛdhiiti bot di ebee náá, ye ɛpebɔya ɛ. Deenek, nyɛ ɛpemaad lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛ les etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ààpakwyɛl náá, bɛdhiiti bot gwyɛ tɔ mesyem. Tin, nyɛ kwyɛl ɛ náá, mena bela ze ɛswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, da bɛ ɛbula pɛ daa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Deenek, ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ aazyɛ yɛ aadi ɛ́ zaka dáa mot djii di ezyɛ zɛdjii ɛ. Dwoo lɛɛg, bhwak djas ɛ waadiib nɛ esa bɛ djas, bot waagwak boo ndum. Tin, bɔs nɛ esa bɛ djas waadhaa e mɛpɛɛa.<verse eid="2PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Dáa di náá, esonok djas aanàkabaadi ɛ, guka ɛnyɔɛpe sa bot di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. Ye nyɔ ɛ náá, mɛfulu mena ɛ dika mbɛɛ mɛfulu mɛ e dɛɛ. Mɛfulu tak, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlyaal ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Tɔ ɛgwaal ɛlu ɛ Zɛɛb, saka mɛghaaz, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neeleebula. Dwoo lɛɛg, yɛ aadi ɛ́ dwoo gwoo nɛghu esa djas di tɔ gwoo aawyɛɛza ghwyɛɛ-ghwyɛɛz ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Tin, da mena gwal ɛ ekɛk gwoo na bes, nɛ bɔs ɛ na bes ee Zɛɛb nakɛk mena ɛ. Pɛ kyee bot ɛ di ekɛ tɔ epiki aakɛdi ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkɛ tɔ etsoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Bɛwɛn bam, tɔ ɛgwal ɛlu ɛlenek, saka mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdi dɛɛ etɛɛ náá, bi needi ààbɛ nɛ mbee ɛtɔɔn e mis ɛ Ghɛŋ, étɛp ɛdi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Guka náá, lyem ɛbhwood e Ghɛŋ'ena ɛpedjɛ mena ze tsik. Tin, mɔn nyɛɛg'ena Pɔl, nakwyal bin ɛ nɛ etsoŋ djas sa Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛy ɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Nyɛ zoolɛɛ sa wat tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛ djas ee nyɛ di elii tɛp'ak ɛ. Tin, ye ɛ́ nɛ mɛlaŋel dinaa bot ɛ àànyɔ ɛtiibal ɛ. Bot ɛ di ààgu sonok ɔ, ààtɔ́ mɛdjek ɔ, nɛ dyeebakwyel ɛlet mɛsuk mɛ tak. Deenek, bɛ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛsa yɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti ekwyala na dɛɛ. Tin, bɛ saab ɛ mɛnyel mɔɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Bɛwɛn bam, yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔ, nenak, dika nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Dika djem, sa bi ààwo ze kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdjak ɛ len, étɛp biyɔ bot ɛ di ààkaab etɛp e Zɛɛb ɛ. Tin, sa bi ààpul ɛpyet ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlóo tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, nɛ ɛgu ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto, Mɛtsik bot'enaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Beta náá, duu di nɛ nɛ, kana nenak kɛtɔ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm. Amɛn!<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
